  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Dairy Impact Nairobi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Given their strong track record in the dairy sector the entrepreneurs of TBL have bought an existing dairy factory, Bio Food Products Ltd, in Kenya. With this acquisition they aim to cater a higher quality of dairy products (yogurt, ice cream and other dairy products), for the growing demand of middle class in Kenya. The plant will be upgraded to the latest industry standards. In order to sustain this higher quality of its dairy products the company needs to ensure constant high quality in-take of raw milk for the long term. This requires establishing lasting relationships with farmers, who supply high quality milk to the dairy plant with the help of Dutch dairy expertise.</narrative>
  </description>
